<title>POLAND: Polish Amica sets IPO min issue price at PLN 28.</title>
<headline>Polish Amica sets IPO min issue price at PLN 28.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Issuer:				   household appliances maker</p>
<p>					     Amica Wronki SA</p>
<p> Type of issue:			  common shares</p>
<p> Minimum price*:			 28</p>
<p> No of Shares Offered:		 2,184,500</p>
<p> No of Existing Shares:		13,106,000</p>
<p>NOTE: * The final issue price would be set through book-building and announced at least two days before the subscription begins.  </p>
<p> Lead Manager:		BMT SA brokerage</p>
<p> Use Of Proceeds:	   paying back long-term loans,</p>
<p>				  investments</p>
<p> Tranches		     No of Shares	   Subscription</p>
<p>				  Offered		  Period</p>
<p> Large-investor	  1,795,000		May 30-June 3</p>
<p> Small-investor	    289,500		June 2-9</p>
<p> Closed			100,000		June 2-9</p>
<p> Earnings Data (million PLN) 1998 forecast  1997 forecast   1996</p>
<p> Net profit:		   42.39	    31.80	    25.31</p>
<p> Pre-tax			 68.37	    51.29	    37.48</p>
<p> Sales:			759.63	    583.14	   369.58</p>
<p>Main Shareholders: Bank Handlowy SA  - 44.4 pct of shares or 47 pct of votes on shareholders meeting Polish Fabryka Armatury Sp z oo - 31.7 pct of shares or 33.5 percent of votes No of existing shares: -</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
